# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill the values. ".env" is git-ignored.
#
# IMPORTANT: Firebase's own keys (project id, API key, app id, FCM sender id) are NOT put here.
# They live in  app/google-services.json  (download it from Firebase Console -> Project settings).
#
# Only the optional value below can go in .env.

# OPTIONAL. Google Sign-In "Web client ID".
# Normally NOT needed: it is read automatically from google-services.json after you enable the
# Google provider and re-download the file. Fill it only if Google Sign-In says "setup adhura hai".
# Where: Firebase Console -> Authentication -> Sign-in method -> Google -> Web SDK configuration
#        -> "Web client ID"   (looks like 1234567890-abcdef.apps.googleusercontent.com)
GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
